2. Functional Groups: Indicators related to functional group composition, such as F02[C-N], F03[C-N], F04[C-N], nN-N, nArCOOR, nArNO2, and nHDon.
3. Hydrogen Bonding Characteristics: Features like nHDon (number of hydrogen donor atoms) and SdO (sum of dO E-states).
